{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c8cea790e2714d3527668d04e50555d89f805f0df9e5129b67f404a4223b99fb",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_a:2_4_035_03_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88d35d2313f30a4f40d2bce96c54439dc1a094b3232327b83356188b4c8c3472",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。我有件事想确认一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_a:2_4_035_03_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d518b501b923bb8038897284de293c31ee691d7e1d2ba0dc24edb22062e21a3",
      "text": "在去下一个现场之前，\n我可以把行李寄放在事务所吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_a:2_4_035_03_09_a:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e4511c79dd301bd751212ca916d4ecb6803d0f2fe2fe7f710a166e18d934922",
      "text": "没问题",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_a:2_4_035_03_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37537fc6109bf2da365def19ad982d397d57bda53d190c1fc686dcc2b8c22c01",
      "text": "谢谢。那我稍后过去一趟。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_a:2_4_035_03_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e28dc93d22936c91bd68e0e556027be313f2a066712a375fa323ca9f496161da",
      "text": "前几天的综艺节目中，我们快乐学习的身影\n听说在孩子们之间也颇受好评。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_a:2_4_035_03_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f977db7b40113d3b34218d71c1fb26b7b5ada7e035dbc1461123073662d06bb6",
      "text": "自从那次录制之后，我自己也正在\n重新体会获取新知识的乐趣。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_a:2_4_035_03_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc96e85ff9cac74f534b426eaa455d182bd89556b39f01842e3352339b3b1b3f",
      "text": "今天赶路的途中我顺便去了一趟书店，\n看到很多想看的参考书，不知不觉行李就变多了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_a:2_4_035_03_09_a:cmd-000023:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30a1db5d8b44efce5399163856f1b7e0a439a97ce1cb31565a96fd392b4cecaa",
      "text": "给大家都带来了良好的转变呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_a:2_4_035_03_09_a:cmd-000024:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43853c94724ee63b0ead5e5698769b77355d203f1de1e60f54934ed0e2f3d0ab",
      "text": "很好奇是什么样的书",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_a:2_4_035_03_09_a:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e70ef8430a2f90060f4e8df9e83f7befae99854d66becd023dc9505e8012cd",
      "text": "是啊。我也觉得橘君向我请教\n作业不会做的地方的次数似乎变多了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_a:2_4_035_03_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b1de181405308ca3d6b12e2fd44a52d619fea3b2897d5d88d7243c373b73c28",
      "text": "如果感兴趣的话，寄放在事务所期间\n你可以随意翻阅。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_a:2_4_035_03_09_a:cmd-000036:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc0c471f2c5faf40dccf78f9065467690e67d62420e571e3a2d19bf0626983c1",
      "text": "能让这样求知的圆环扩散开来，\n是一件非常令人欣喜的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_a:2_4_035_03_09_a:cmd-000038:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ca95caea3d0bba8d0b1fc8bd218db0f101813c76ec27735111ed32c94879582",
      "text": "我自己今后也想更加积极地学习，\n并将那份美好传达出去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_403_2_4_035_03_09_a:2_4_035_03_09_a:cmd-000040:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f30a4788cdbc9d02542d53d8e6028b129405dac7893f7aca944d36dadad3bbd8",
      "text": "为此，首先要在接下来的工作中全力以赴。\n那么，稍后在事务所见。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
